CONTROLS

{2}PAUSE: {1}
'F1'	Pauses Game.

In pause screen move right to choose 
CONTinue.Move left to choose QUIT. Press 
fire to select chosen option

{2}QUIT: {1}
F10 - Quits game and returns to main menu.

{2}BACK: {1}
Pressing 'UNDO' (or Fire B on jaguar pads)
acts as a back button, allowing you to 
move back through screens in the frontend.
